Standards and acknowledgements
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

* The wire protocol implementation follows the STOMP 1.2 specification
  (https://stomp.github.io/stomp-specification-1.2.html).
* The WebSocket transport follows RFC 6455.
* The public client interface was inspired by the command line client
  https://github.com/amirabiri/stomp-cli. No source code was copied from it.
